DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-09-26T04:30:00&endDate=2026-09-28T00:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nCENTRAL LINE: Saturday 26 September\, from 0530 and all day Sunday 27 September\, no  service (including Saturday Night Tube) between Liverpool Street and Woodford / Newbury Park. Replacement buses operate. For Night journeys to Wanstead\, Redbridge and Gants Hill\, please use Night Bus Route N8.
