BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-09-26T01:10:00&endDate=2026-09-26T04:30:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nCENTRAL LINE: Saturday 26 September\, between 0210 and 0530\, no Night Tube service between Marble Arch and Loughton / Hainault (via Newbury Park). Replacement bus service CL5 operates between Stratford City Bus Station (for Stratford) and Loughton via Leyton\, Leytonstone (eastbound buses serve Leytonstone High Road instead)\, Snaresbrook\, South Woodford\, Woodford and Buckhurst Hill. Use Night Bus N8 for Wanstead\, Redbridge\, Gants Hill\, Barkingside\, Fairlop (Barkingside\, Fullwell Cross) and Hainault.
